# Node
node_modules/
dist/
# Compiled Cloud Functions output only (see firebase/functions/tsconfig.json
# outDir) — deliberately NOT a bare `lib/` pattern. An unanchored `lib/`
# here previously matched ANY directory named `lib` anywhere in the repo,
# including `firebase/functions/src/lib/`, which is real, hand-written
# source code (auth/audit/idempotency/rateLimit helpers every Cloud
# Function imports) — that meant it was silently never committed at all,
# and the whole Functions package couldn't compile as a result. See
# IMPLIMENTATION_STATUS.MD Phase 14 and FIREBASE_FUNCTIONS_ARCHITECTURE.md
# §11.1 for the full account of what that broke and how it was found.
/firebase/functions/lib/
*.tsbuildinfo
.npm-global/

